    me_method_receiver_field_write_lost_native_2026-11-09, 0, "red native stage2_new4 (base 1f0674fc682): n=2 and siblings b/c/hi/hc/a/ca all 2; IR shows Box.bump loads self.n into alloca and never stores it. MIR spec red at 1f0674fc682 (no SetField), green at 110719b6d2a; disabling the merge entry of #7998 turns it red again. Native re-verify needs a stage2 rebuilt from >= 1e5c263034a."
    me_method_receiver_field_write_lost_native_2026-11-09, 1, "2026-11-26 aarch64 Linux run (not source review): admitted aarch64 Stage 2 built from origin/release/1.0.0 76892f19a3a (stage2-sanity pass, sha256 567541f4ffd021a1, cranelift-built); probes built with SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP=1 SIMPLE_NATIVE_GO_TO_END=1 SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS=0 SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP_WHOLE_PROGRAM=1 <stage2> native-build main.spl --backend=<b> --entry-closure. test/s3sanity/me_writeback.spl prints n=5 on cranelift and llvm (was n=2 at 1f0674fc682); me_writeback_siblings.spl prints b=5 c=5 hi=5 hc=5 a=5 ca=5 on both backends (all were 2). Seed 11-26 runs me_method_field_writeback_spec 3/3. Status -> verified."

